OL,3,GNEWSAOriginal Traitors star became film
OL,4,Aactor after show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA contestant from the first UK series
OL,7,Fof The Traitors has said the show
OL,8,Ftransformed his life and helped launch
OL,9,Fhis acting career.
OL,11,FKieran Tompsett, 46, from Stevenage,
OL,12,FHertfordshire, was recruited as a
OL,13,Ftraitor towards the end of the 2022
OL,14,Fseries, he was banished during the
OL,15,Ffinal episode, but memorably hinted at
OL,16,Fthe identity of the last remaining
OL,17,Ftraitor as he left.
OL,19,FTompsett said the experience prompted
OL,20,Fhim to ask: "What else do I want to do
OL,21,Fnow?" He then decided to attend Ashley
OL,22,FWalters' Kingdom Drama School.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
